category: Libs
build-depends: cygport git libiconv-devel libintl-devel libgmock-devel libgtest-devel libyaml-cpp-devel
sdesc: "Datadog's implementation of a WAF engine (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "libddwaf is Datadog's implementation of a Web Application Firewall (WAF)
engine, with a goal of low performance and memory overhead, and embeddability
in a wide variety of language runtimes through a C API."
